meta {
  name: 10. Delete
  type: http
  seq: 10
}

delete {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/projects/items/{{userStoryId}}
  body: none
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
}

docs {
  Deletes the user story and cascades to its remaining children (the task moved under it in step 6,
  which by now also has a field value set in step 9) - also removing their SprintItem and
  ItemFieldValue rows. Deleting a generic item (id from "List Tree") should fail with
  "Generic container items cannot be deleted".
}
